        'This ongoing check reflects just how much your body keeps adapting through pregnancy; today\'s normal levels don\'t mean the topic is closed for good.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.takeaways, '', [], [
        'Iron needs rise further in the second half of pregnancy.',
        'Blood volume expansion and your baby\'s own iron stores both contribute.',
