      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'Feed your baby as early and often as advised, since colostrum and early feeds genuinely help stabilise their blood sugar. If levels are low and not improving, your baby may need a short stay in the NICU for monitoring and support, which is a precaution, not necessarily a sign of a lasting problem.',
